			"• マントは布製。取付部が可動しマントの動きも再現可能。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Achilles hyperfunction with built-in core skeleton and color reproduction through parts division!",
			"• Precise mechanical details are reproduced on the core skeleton.",
			"• Each armor reproduced with multicolored molding can be smoothly attached and detached.",
			"• The cloak is made of cloth. The mounting part is movable and the movement of the cloak can be reproduced."
		]
